# Used only by `npm run build` (Vite loads this for the "production" mode
# automatically) — NOT by `npm run dev`, which keeps using .env's absolute
# http://localhost:8010 for local development.
#
# Empty on purpose: single-domain hosting (gharnepal.kitetool.com serves
# both this built app and the Laravel API from the same origin), so the
# API client's baseURL should be a same-origin relative path ("/api/v1"),
# not a hardcoded domain — see src/lib/api/client.ts's `apiOrigin` fallback
# chain (`import.meta.env.VITE_API_URL ?? '...'`; an empty string here is
# a defined value, so the fallback never kicks in).
VITE_API_URL=
